      },
      "description": "Clone of reward_scale10 ED (6a52cfe1) with reward_scale_factor 10->1. Diagnosed the stage-0 collapse of job 6a63e680: reward_scale=10 on an O(1) reward (GOAL_BONUS 1.0, CRASH -1.0) inflated MSE critic loss ~100x (critic_loss 130-660, oscillating) and over-weighted reward vs entropy so alpha collapsed 1.0->0.18 and the policy went deterministic/crash-prone by ~40k steps. Lowering to 1.0 keeps Q ~O(5-13), stabilizes the critic, and restores the reward/entropy balance. Single-variable change; everything else (curriculum, LRs 3e-5, AWAC lambda 0.5, demos) identical.",
